{"2886380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cryptica", "steam_appid": 2886380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cryptica is a narrative-based psychological horror game where the apocalypse is only the beginning. Explore the enigmatic lands of Antarctica and its surrounding areas while the world ends.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/0d2358222a68c9f192ec23ddefeaa4e5.poster.avif?t=1785851494\" width=500 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/0d2358222a68c9f192ec23ddefeaa4e5.webm?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/0d2358222a68c9f192ec23ddefeaa4e5.mp4?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ari Harper, as he desperately attempts to find his missing sister, who has disappeared with a film crew while making a documentary in Antarctica. Uncover unfathomable horrors, discover ancestral secrets, and find your sister and the missing film crew at all costs.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can explore in 1st or 3rd-person modes in massive rustic and surreal environments. Go forth and explore freely. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/add15036b3a6d7435bca5c436ade37c4.poster.avif?t=1785851494\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/add15036b3a6d7435bca5c436ade37c4.webm?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/add15036b3a6d7435bca5c436ade37c4.mp4?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Uncertainty </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unprecedented permafrost melt has given life to a new fungus in your exploration area. This fungus can  cause auditory and visual hallucinations. Embrace or reject this mechanic at your leisure. You decide what’s real and what’s imagination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/61dcdfcecacb5e971850f94486ef590c.poster.avif?t=1785851494\" width=500 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/61dcdfcecacb5e971850f94486ef590c.webm?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/61dcdfcecacb5e971850f94486ef590c.mp4?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> abandoned mines, desolate whaling outposts, and ancient archeological sites all across Antarctica.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/3510c1bd5415f0efd516721ec4e4ba2a.poster.avif?t=1785851494\" width=500 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/3510c1bd5415f0efd516721ec4e4ba2a.webm?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/3510c1bd5415f0efd516721ec4e4ba2a.mp4?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIND FOOTAGE</strong> that will provide helpful insight into what happened to the missing film crew and learn of the horrors that happened here hundreds of years ago. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/20dfd7eac3bc5ca2ca1e709400d7817a.poster.avif?t=1785851494\" width=400 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/20dfd7eac3bc5ca2ca1e709400d7817a.webm?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/20dfd7eac3bc5ca2ca1e709400d7817a.mp4?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/be2da9b59838adccd3950e039962a545.poster.avif?t=1785851494\" width=400 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/be2da9b59838adccd3950e039962a545.webm?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/be2da9b59838adccd3950e039962a545.mp4?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/50ceb68203f5c8fdbf27da9b934cc57c.poster.avif?t=1785851494\" width=400 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/50ceb68203f5c8fdbf27da9b934cc57c.webm?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/50ceb68203f5c8fdbf27da9b934cc57c.mp4?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>UNCOVER </strong>Inter-dimensional beings, ghosts, UAP, cryptids and plenty of conspiracies...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/0bb3b4d4fb8cc3909dae6126740cbcfc.avif?t=1785851494\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras_big/0bb3b4d4fb8cc3909dae6126740cbcfc.avif?t=1785851494 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Cryptica expect the unexpected. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic horrors await.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-5 Hours Gameplay</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cryptica is a narrative-based psychological horror game where the apocalypse is only the beginning. Explore the enigmatic lands of Antarctica and its surrounding areas while the world ends.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/0d2358222a68c9f192ec23ddefeaa4e5.poster.avif?t=1785851494\" width=500 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/0d2358222a68c9f192ec23ddefeaa4e5.webm?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/0d2358222a68c9f192ec23ddefeaa4e5.mp4?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ari Harper, as he desperately attempts to find his missing sister, who has disappeared with a film crew while making a documentary in Antarctica. Uncover unfathomable horrors, discover ancestral secrets, and find your sister and the missing film crew at all costs.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can explore in 1st or 3rd-person modes in massive rustic and surreal environments. Go forth and explore freely. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/add15036b3a6d7435bca5c436ade37c4.poster.avif?t=1785851494\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/add15036b3a6d7435bca5c436ade37c4.webm?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/add15036b3a6d7435bca5c436ade37c4.mp4?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Psychological Uncertainty </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unprecedented permafrost melt has given life to a new fungus in your exploration area. This fungus can  cause auditory and visual hallucinations. Embrace or reject this mechanic at your leisure. You decide what’s real and what’s imagination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/61dcdfcecacb5e971850f94486ef590c.poster.avif?t=1785851494\" width=500 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/61dcdfcecacb5e971850f94486ef590c.webm?t=1785851494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886380/extras/61dcdfcecacb5e971850f94486e